OL,3,GNEWSADriver who rammed car and pub
OL,4,Aoutbuilding jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who deliberately reversed at
OL,7,Fspeed into a car and an outbuilding in
OL,8,Fa pub car park has been jailed.
OL,10,FGavin Thorpe, 42, smashed into the
OL,11,Fvehicle and building outside The Park
OL,12,Fpub in the Wibsey area of Bradford in
OL,13,FJune.
OL,15,FCCTV footage of the dangerous driving
OL,16,Fwas widely shared on social media
OL,17,Ffollowing the incident, which Bradford
OL,18,FCrown Court heard had been committed
OL,19,Fout of "rage and anger".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
